\\builtin\dict;
# builtin/dict.src - default implementation of the built-in Dict type (trust::Dict).
#
# The definition uses `=` (implementation of a PRE-DECLARED type). dict.hpp includes
# stdlib/builtin/rational.hpp itself (TypedValue stores trust::Rational by value): that is a
# property of the C++ header, not a compiler-known dependency. A program that uses Rational as a
# value still needs Rational's own implementation (checked by the uniform provider-gate).

@[include("@stdlib/builtin/dict.hpp")@]
Dict = %trust::Dict {
    size^(): Int64 := %size ...;
};